#X text 240 83 The object reads a signal from the array and writes
a signal into the array at the same time. On each audio block it performs
the following operations in order: read \, write \, output. The reading
index \, signal to write \, and write index are provided on three separate
audio inlets. The value read from the array is mixed with the written
signal according to the @mix property and sent to the audio outlet.;
